{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道那种生活仍重要，却累得连自己为什么舍不得都说不清，也提不起劲争取。\",\n      \"key\": \"为什么舍不得\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得丢开那一步，也舍不得那份安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得丢开\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕再往前又把自己逼得太狠，可那些妨碍那种生活的事仍让他放不下。\",\n      \"key\": \"逼得太狠\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他反复想着自己究竟想护住什么，想歇一歇也不等于要把它丢下。\",\n      \"key\": \"想歇一歇\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他还不知道往后该怎么过，却不再急着判哪一边错，逼自己立刻选边的劲也松了一点。\",\n      \"key\": \"选边的劲也松\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R45\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把看清愿望却没有勇气的总结改成具体的疲惫、说不清缘由和提不起劲；保留那种生活仍然重要的事实。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R46\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-2\", \"S10-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动与安宁都曾帮过他，分别回指真实经历；写明他怕再被自己逼得太狠，也放不下仍待面对的难处。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R47\", \"R48\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-3\", \"S10-4\", \"S10-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去整齐的条件式要求和重复的无能为力，找回他反复思量自己想护住什么的过程，并保留暂时没有答案的状态。删除S09-2到S10-1及S05-4到S10-4的牵强箭头，分别改由更直接的前因说明。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R49\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并补足因果\",\n      \"why\": \"保留非此即彼的逼迫开始松动这一变化，由S10-4中他想到歇息不等于放弃的具体念头引出，不再把变化归结为单纯想得久了。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "badcc254-542e-42c4-ae10-4f71355ea308", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T175057360677Z", "elapsed_seconds": 529.156, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:59:46.530021+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2f83fc1c75fe8961f68aca646d7c0e9d6e4a9c74e001ee22a513fc2f18876ec4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgp